# The board

Import WebBoard from "../src/web_board.lg".
Import UiSite from "../src/ui_site.lg".
Import UiBoard from "../src/ui_board.lg".

The factory's board, `/board`: one lane per stage, in the order work moves, each
with its count, the units waiting and leased in it, and its best-ranked problems.

## Page /board

Head:
    <title>MaCSad — the board</title>

State:
    Let lanes be a new Seq of BoardLane.
    Let cards be a new Seq of BoardCard.
    Let error be "".

Actions:
    When the page loads:
        Get "/api/v1/board" as Seq of BoardLane, then gotLanes.
        Get "/api/v1/board/cards?per=8" as Seq of BoardCard, then gotCards.

    Every 30 seconds as refresh:
        Get "/api/v1/board" as Seq of BoardLane, then gotLanes.
        Get "/api/v1/board/cards?per=8" as Seq of BoardCard, then gotCards.

    To gotLanes (answer: Result of Seq of BoardLane and HttpError):
        Inspect answer:
            When Ok (list):
                Set lanes to list.
                Set error to "".
            When Err (e):
                Set error to e's message.

    To gotCards (answer: Result of Seq of BoardCard and HttpError):
        Inspect answer:
            When Ok (list):
                Set cards to list.
            When Err (e):
                Set error to e's message.

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <PageHead eyebrow="The board" title="Where every problem stands">
        <p class="lede">A problem moves right as it is formalized, attacked and settled. Only the trusted verifier moves one to solved,
          refuted or partial, on a proof the LOGOS kernel checked.</p>
      </PageHead>
      {if error is not equal to "":}<p class="error-banner" role="alert" id="error">{error}</p>{end}
      <div class="lanes" id="lanes">
        {for each l in lanes, keyed by l's stage:}<LaneColumn lane={l} cards={cards}/>{else:}<p class="empty">Loading the board…</p>{end}
      </div>
    {end}

## Test: the board draws a lane per stage with its cards

Given that GET "/api/v1/board" answers 200 with """[{{"stage": "ranked", "problems": 102819, "readyUnits": 7, "leasedUnits": 1},
  {{"stage": "solved", "problems": 0, "readyUnits": 0, "leasedUnits": 0}}]""".
Given that GET "/api/v1/board/cards?per=8" answers 200 with """[{{"problemId": "opdp:1", "title": "P versus NP",
  "stage": "ranked", "rankBp": 9000, "cohort": "UnsolvedMath", "collection": "millennium-prize", "unitKind": "prove", "holder": "ada"}}]""".
Expect that the count of ".lane" is equal to 2.
Expect that the text of "#lane-ranked .lane-count" is equal to "102,819".
Expect that the text of "#lane-ranked .meta" is equal to "prove leased by ada".
Expect that the text of "#lane-solved .empty" is equal to "No problem stands here yet.".

## Test: a board the coordinator cannot serve says why

Given that GET "/api/v1/board" answers 503 with "down".
Given that GET "/api/v1/board/cards?per=8" answers 503 with "down".
Expect that the text of "#error" is equal to "503: down".
